Altars are not a prerequisite to #prayer... you can pray every ~600
turns or so no matter where you are as long as your god is not angry.
If your alignment is positive, it will be guaranteed to at least cure
hp loss if you are below 7 hp or below 1/7 of your max hp, among other
life threatening conditions. If you are in a situation like that, it
can even be safe to pray as early as ~400 turns after you last prayer,
but it's usually better not to, since praying too early makes your god
angry.

